OL,3,GNEWSARuins and restorations: New
OL,4,Aarchive chronicles Scotland's castles
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe global fascination with Scotland's
OL,7,Fcastles shows little sign of dimming.
OL,9,FFrom Americans fulfilling a lifelong
OL,10,Fdream to TV star Alan Carr moving into
OL,11,Fhis "turret era", interest in owning
OL,12,Fone has rarely been higher.
OL,14,FFor those of us with more modest
OL,15,Fbudgets, the striking looks and stories
OL,16,Fbehind these structures are an enduring
OL,17,Fattraction.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
