OL,3,GNEWSARuins and restorations: New
OL,4,Aarchive chronicles Scotland's castles
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow a new archive hopes to provide a
OL,7,Fcomprehensive, detailed and
OL,8,Fnationally-accessible picture of the
OL,9,Fcondition of the nation's castles,
OL,10,Ftheir history and what their future
OL,11,Fmight hold.
